| Channel detail | **Hero:** `PUBLIC_LANDING_HERO_TRIAL_CTA` → `/pricing`; **feature rows / repeats:** `PUBLIC_LANDING_COMPACT_TRIAL_CTA` (presenter `heroCtaText` / `featureCtaText`, `hero-copy.ts`) |
